<p>Hi <%= @user.name.presence || @user.email %>,</p>

<p>Use the code below to sign in to Eventful. It will expire in 10 minutes.</p>

<p style="font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 600;"> <%= @otp.code %> </p>

<p>
  Or click the button below to sign in immediately:
</p>

<p>
  <a href="<%= @login_url %>" style="display: inline-block; padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem; background: #338eda; color: white; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 0.5rem;">
    Sign in to Eventful
  </a>
</p>

<p>If you did not request this email, you can safely ignore it.</p>
